<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Privacy & Child Safeguarding' }) %>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <h1>Privacy &amp; Child Safeguarding</h1>
    <p>
      This dashboard introduces children supported by Hope Beyond Measure to potential
      sponsors. Because it shares information about minors, we apply strict safeguards.
    </p>

    <h2>What we publish — and what we never publish</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We display <strong>first names only</strong>, never surnames.</li>
      <li>Locations are shown at <strong>region or town level only</strong> — never an
          address, school name, or anything that could identify where a child can be found.</li>
      <li>If a date of birth is on record, only the <strong>age</strong> is displayed.</li>
      <li>Photos are reviewed so they don’t reveal identifying background details, and all
          technical metadata (including GPS coordinates) is removed automatically on upload.</li>
      <li>Family circumstances such as income are described in general terms.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Consent</h2>
    <p>
      A profile is only published after a parent or guardian has given documented consent.
      If consent is withdrawn, the profile is taken offline immediately.
    </p>

    <h2>Your data as a visitor</h2>
    <p>
      Browsing this site requires no account and no personal data from you. We don’t use
      advertising or tracking cookies. A technical cookie is used only for organizer login.
    </p>

    <h2>Data deletion &amp; contact</h2>
    <p>
      Parents, guardians, or their representatives can request correction or deletion of a
      child’s data at any time via our
      <a href="<%= mainSite %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">main website</a>.
      Deletion requests are honored without undue delay.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/foot') %>
